    "description": "As cities face increasing climate risks, researchers are racing to model resilience in megacities. While analyzing adaptation strategies across 43 megacities, this talk found that standard data often lacks the critical details on resilience modeling. This lightning talk presents a \"Gap Analysis\" from the perspective of a climate researcher - a prioritized wish list of features that, if mapped, would transform OpenStreetMap from a navigational tool into a critical engine for global climate adaptation. Originally published by OSM US under a CC license: https://youtube.com/watch?v=ooyzka8X1F8",
